 SG_ V12_mV : 16|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "mV" Host
 SG_ I_24V_mA : 32|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "mA" Host
 SG_ Sys_State : 48|8@1+ (1,0) [0|2] "" Host
 SG_ Error_Mask : 56|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" Host

